{"step_index":817,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-28T22:15:37Z","thinking":"**Defining Runtime Tokens**\n\nI'm working on adding keywords and operators to the `TokenType` enum within `ops/runtime/sovrac.zig`. I've just defined keywords like `KwIf`, `KwElse`, `KwWhile`, and `KwReturn`. I've also included operators: `Plus`, `Minus`, `Star`, `Slash`, `CmpEq`, `CmpNe`, `CmpLt`, and `CmpGt`. Now I'm checking how the lexer behaves. It seems that symbols such as `+` are mapped to `.Plus`, as expected.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"// FULL LOWERED EXPRESSION & CONTROL FLOW TEST (.sovra)\n// Demonstrates sovrac v3.0 lowering arithmetic (+, -, *), gate bl branch calls, and while loops to ARM64 machine instructions!\n\n@invariant(truth, \"Zero unverified citations or surface placeholders\")\nfn process_telemetry() {\n    val a: i64 = 100;\n    val b: i64 = 250;\n    val sum: i64 = a + b;\n    val diff: i64 = b - a;\n\n    val raw_payload: candidate<ToolCall> = model.infer(\"Audit state payload\");\n    val clean_decision: decision<ToolCall> = gate(raw_payload);\n\n    while (sum > 0) {\n        system.execute(clean_decision);\n    }\n}\n","Description":"Create lowered expression, arithmetic, function call, and control flow test file for sovrac v3.0","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"/Volumes/Untitled/SSOT_Agentic_Brain_v1.1.0_ENGINEERING_RELEASE/ops/runtime/full_lowered_expr_test.sovra","toolAction":"Writing full_lowered_expr_test.sovra","toolSummary":"Write full_lowered_expr_test.sovra"}}]}
